            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88GB18, Solid Brass 18\" Bathroom Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known, this solid brass grab bar is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished chrome finishes. The modern style of the 88 series 18\" bathroom grab bar allows it to look good while still being functional; and it is great for any contemporary setting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88GB18-specifications.gif?v=1704354571\" width=\"600\" height=\"246\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88GB18 18\" Grab Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb24\"><b>24\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/32-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb32\"><b>32\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/36-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb36\"><b>36\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/42-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb42\"><b>42\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass 18 Inch Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88gb18.pdf?v=1691095383\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88GB18 18\" Grab Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 grab bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
